description: Vibe Aegis Always-On Security & UI/UX Safeguard Rules and 6-Stage Audit Protocol
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: true

Follow all security and UI/UX engineering standards in `AGENTS.md`:
1. Never expose private keys or tokens in client-side env vars (`NEXT_PUBLIC_*`, `VITE_*`, `EXPO_PUBLIC_*`).
2. Enforce server-side authentication, ownership checks (prevent IDOR), and Database Row-Level Security (RLS).
3. Never trust client-submitted prices in payment checkouts; always verify webhook signatures.
4. Every UI button/link must be wired to a real action (no `href="#"` or empty `onClick`), disable during async flight (`disabled={isLoading}`), and handle loading, empty, and error states.
5. Ensure mobile responsiveness (`320px–375px` without horizontal overflow) and WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility.
6. When asked to audit or prepare for production, run `python3 .aegis/scripts/aegis_scan.py . --output .aegis/scan-report.json` and execute the 6-stage Hunter -> Skeptic -> Referee loop in `.agents/skills/vibe-aegis/SKILL.md`.
